  "nl_text": "The database name is rschema_0281, and it contains five tables: Exhibition, Curator, Exhibit, Exhibition_Management, and Exhibit_Association. The Exhibition table contains information about exhibitions, including the exhibition name, location, start and end time, and a unique exhibition ID. The Curator table contains information about curators, including their name, email, and phone number, and a unique curator ID. The Exhibit table contains information about exhibits, including the exhibit name, description, image path, and source, and a unique exhibit ID. The Exhibition_Management table contains information about the relationship between exhibitions and curators, including the curator ID and exhibition ID, and specifies that the combination of these two IDs must be unique. The Exhibit_Association table contains information about the relationship between exhibits and exhibitions, including the exhibit ID and exhibition ID, and specifies that the combination of these two IDs must be unique.",
  "gold_question": "The Cultural Arts Company needs to manage multiple exhibitions. Each exhibition has multiple curators and exhibits. The system needs to record the name, location, start time, and end time of each exhibition, as well as the information of curators and exhibits.",
